  "introduction": "Hi, I'm Kan Kusakabe, a third‑year PhD student in Information Science at Hokkaido University. My work centers on interactive mobile interfaces (accessory‑style designs, advanced sensing, and gesture input) and Accesibility Technology. By combining machine learning with rapid prototyping and 3D printing, I create solutions that seamlessly blend digital and physical experiences. I'm open to research collaborations, internships, and career opportunities—feel free to get in touch!",
